{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24740","headline":"送刘郎中赴任苏州 · 白居易","name":"送刘郎中赴任苏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仁风膏雨去随轮，胜境欢游到逐身。\n水驿路穿儿店月，花船棹入女湖春。\n宣城独咏窗中岫，柳恽单题汀上苹。\n何似姑苏诗太守，吟诗相继有三人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}